{"4802100":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Perfumed Palaces: Purgatory Simulator","steam_appid":4802100,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4905510],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>On July 12th 2025, the urban explorer known online as &quot;hueyfreeman99&quot; posted a video to his Youtube channel titled<\/i><strong> BENSEN RIO BLAIR HOUSE<\/strong> <i>in which he spends 14 minutes approaching and then investigating the strange bungalow associated with 10 years of cult activity surrounding underage persons located over 3 miles by foot from the nearest road. <\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Amongst the abandoned refuse which included cracked plastic TV Dinner boxes, forgotten toys, torn children's clothing,  televisions with the power cords cut, numerous damaged PS3 consoles, drug paraphernalia, secondhand furniture, and large wooden puppets, he found a BD-R inside of an unlabeled PS3 game case. At the end of his video, he included footage of the decompiled and heavily corrupted contents of the homebrew game. <\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It featured a heavily distorted vision  of a maze inhabited by puppet enemies that required the player to roll matches on a slot machine to move around. After exploring the maze half-heartedly and dying at the hands of a puppet labeled &quot;Levi&quot; on it's chest he finished his video with a titlecard explaining that he felt funny after playing for only a few moments, and would post more footage the next day after getting some rest. <\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The next morning, the video and the 7 year old &quot;hueyfreeman99&quot; Youtube account had been deleted.<\/i> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>On December 29th of 2025, Softgnos Psychotronics agents infiltrated the alleged site of prolonged underage cult activity, The Bensen Rio Blair House, primarily in interest in extracting the aforementioned homebrew artifact for commercial exploitation. The &quot;Large Wooden Puppets&quot; were nowhere to be found. The operation was technically successful and the game in question is reproduced in full here, for your engagement. <\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4802100\/extras\/3301bff88b4e2b2381e9a6fc6c0cb6c5.webp?t=1793682016\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4802100\/extras\/3301bff88b4e2b2381e9a6fc6c0cb6c5.poster.avif?t=1793682016\" class=\"bb_img\" width=256 height=256 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>PRESENTS <\/i><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4802100\/extras\/14a6e4b5e1de727fe7baca08ce814abc.avif?t=1793682016\" width=256 height=256 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DESTROY THE PUPPETS,<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>OR RUN FROM THEM.<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4802100\/extras\/1f24333bea340a997f43b290e7f01eb0.webp?t=1793682016\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4802100\/extras\/1f24333bea340a997f43b290e7f01eb0.poster.avif?t=1793682016\" class=\"bb_img\" width=256 height=256 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DEFEAT THE BOSSES,<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>OR SNEAK PAST THEM.<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4802100\/extras\/e22938d1fd5aca41b60a8570a935f5d0.avif?t=1793682016\" width=256 height=256 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXPLORE THE LIMINAL SPACE, <\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>WHY DOES THIS PLACE SEEM SO FAMILIAR?<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4802100\/extras\/4e45cef85002a2325de115ce6bafc4a0.poster.avif?t=1793682016\" width=512 height=94 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4802100\/extras\/4e45cef85002a2325de115ce6bafc4a0.webm?t=1793682016\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4802100\/extras\/4e45cef85002a2325de115ce6bafc4a0.mp4?t=1793682016\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ESCAPE IS AS EASY AS FINDING A NEEDLE, <\/strong> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>IN 999,999,999 HAYSTACKS<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4802100\/extras\/ca5649fefe03ba12b3a459676478961c.avif?t=1793682016\" width=256 height=256 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>PERFUMED PALACES: PURGATORY SIMULATOR<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>A NEW &quot;FOUND HORROR&quot; EXPERIENCE.<\/i><\/strong><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>On July 12th 2025, the urban explorer known online as &quot;hueyfreeman99&quot; posted a video to his Youtube channel titled<\/i><strong> BENSEN RIO BLAIR HOUSE<\/strong> <i>in which he spends 14 minutes approaching and then investigating the strange bungalow associated with 10 years of cult activity surrounding underage persons located over 3 miles by foot from the nearest road. <\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Amongst the abandoned refuse which included cracked plastic TV Dinner boxes, forgotten toys, torn children's clothing,  televisions with the power cords cut, numerous damaged PS3 consoles, drug paraphernalia, secondhand furniture, and large wooden puppets, he found a BD-R inside of an unlabeled PS3 game case. At the end of his video, he included footage of the decompiled and heavily corrupted contents of the homebrew game. <\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It featured a heavily distorted vision  of a maze inhabited by puppet enemies that required the player to roll matches on a slot machine to move around. After exploring the maze half-heartedly and dying at the hands of a puppet labeled &quot;Levi&quot; on it's chest he finished his video with a titlecard explaining that he felt funny after playing for only a few moments, and would post more footage the next day after getting some rest. <\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The next morning, the video and the 7 year old &quot;hueyfreeman99&quot; Youtube account had been deleted.<\/i> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>On December 29th of 2025, Softgnos Psychotronics agents infiltrated the alleged site of prolonged underage cult activity, The Bensen Rio Blair House, primarily in interest in extracting the aforementioned homebrew artifact for commercial exploitation. The &quot;Large Wooden Puppets&quot; were nowhere to be found. The operation was technically successful and the game in question is reproduced in full here, for your engagement. <\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4802100\/extr